<custom_item>
  type        : FILE_CONTENT_CHECK
  description : "1.0269 - RHEL - Ensure gpgcheck is globally activated - dnf.conf"
  info        : "The gpgcheck option, found in the main section of the /etc/dnf/dnf."
  solution    : "Configure this setting to the expected baseline value shown in the control description and value_data."
  reference   : "NIST 800-53r5|RA-5SI-2 SI-2(2)"
  see_also    : "See HTH Policies and Standards"
